### 1. 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smokeuser",
  "password": "Study123456",
  "nickname": "学习用户",
  "email": "smoke@example.com"
}

### 2. 重复注册（期望 409 用户名已存在）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smokeuser",
  "password": "Study123456"
}

### 3. 密码过短（期望 400 密码至少需要8位）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "shortpassword",
  "password": "123"
}

### 4. 登录失败（期望 401）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smokeuser",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

### 5. 登录成功（同时把 token 写入环境变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "smokeuser",
  "password": "Study123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 6. 当前用户信息
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. 个人 AI 用量
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/me/ai-usage
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. 资料列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. 今日任务
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. 待办清单
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/upcoming?days=0
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. 学习看板数据
GET http://localhost:8080/api/statistics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. 管理员接口（普通用户访问期望 403）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/admin/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. 健康检查（无需登录）
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
